{"{n} colors":"{n} 种颜色","Fill every color quota to win. Some stages limit your moves or time — unused moves and fast finishes earn bonus points.":"填满每个颜色配额即可获胜。有些阶段限制你的动作或时间——未使用的动作和快速完成可以获得奖励积分。","Tap a group of two or more touching cubes of the same color to pop it. Bigger groups score more.":"点击一组两个或多个相同颜色的接触立方体以弹出它。更大的团体得分更高。","This group fills a goal color.":"该组填充目标颜色。","A new color joins the wall: grape.":"一种新颜色加入了墙壁：葡萄紫。","Rockets are the fastest way to fill two colors at once.":"火箭是同时填充两种颜色的最快方式。","The sixth color: tangerine. The wall gets busier.":"第六种颜色：橘红色。墙壁变得更加忙碌。","MASTERY: six colors, tight budget.":"掌握：六种颜色，预算紧张。","Six-Color Squeeze":"六色挤压","Only three colors — giant groups and bombs everywhere. 14 moves, no undo.":"只有三种颜色——巨型群体和炸弹无处不在。 14 步，不可撤消。","Four colors in 90 seconds. No undo.":"90秒内四种颜色。无法撤消。","Cubes of the same color stick together. Tap any group of 2 or more matching cubes to pop them. Try it now — any group works.":"相同颜色的立方体会粘在一起。点击任何2个或更多相同立方体的组来弹出它们。现在试试——任何组都可以。","That move is not allowed.":"该移动不允许。","Popped {n} cubes.":"爆开的{n}立方体。","Rocket forged.":"火箭锻造。","Rocket fired.":"火箭发射。","Bomb forged.":"炸弹锻造了。","Bomb exploded.":"炸弹爆炸了。","Chain of {n} specials.":"{n} 个特殊连锁。","Board reshuffled.":"棋盘已重新洗牌。","Move undone.":"移动已撤销。","Hint shown.":"显示提示。","Stage complete.":"阶段完成。","Round over.":"回合结束。","Wave {n} complete.":"波{n}完成。","Achievement unlocked.":"成就已解锁。","Goal filled.":"目标已实现。","15 seconds left.":"剩余 15 秒。","{keys} (reset)":"{keys}（复位）","(unlock at {n}★)":"（在 {n}★ 时解锁）","Tutorial reset. Lesson 1 is ready.":"教程重置。第 1 课已准备就绪。","Reset journey stars, achievements, and saved rounds?":"重置旅程星星、成就和已保存回合？","Progress reset.":"进度已重置。","{n} moves":"{n} 步","endless":"无尽","Finish the previous stage to unlock.":"完成前一阶段即可解锁。","done":"已完成","Seed {seed}":"种子 {seed}","no move limit":"无移动限制","Your best today: {n} points":"您今天的最佳成绩：{n} 分","New challenge in {h}h {m}m (server-synced).":"{h}h {m}m（服务器同步）中的新挑战。","offline-capable":"能够离线","Playing as {name}":"正在以 