arn":"教学","Achievements":"成就","Settings":"设置","Help":"帮助","Forty authored stages. Finish a stage to unlock the next; mastery stages test combined mechanics.":"四十个创作阶段。完成一个阶段即可解锁下一个阶段；掌握阶段测试组合力学。","Back":"返回","Play today's challenge":"参加今天的挑战","Today's board (this device)":"今日棋盘（本设备）","Unranked. Undo and hints allowed. No effect on ratings.":"未排名。允许撤消和提示。对收视率没有影响。","Challenges":"挑战","Constrained goals: move limits, speed targets, restricted tools.":"约束目标：移动限制、速度目标、受限工具。","Score Chase — Endless Wall":"分数追逐——无尽的墙","Start run":"开始运行","Your best runs (local)":"您的最佳跑步成绩（本地）","Interactive lessons. Each one asks you to perform the rule yourself.":"互动课程。每个规则都要求您自己执行该规则。","Audio":"音频","Show text captions for sounds":"显示声音的文本标题","Studio theme":"工作室主题","Accessibility":"无障碍","Left-handed action tray":"左手操作托盘","Progress":"进度","Replay tutorial":"重放教程","Reset all progress":"重置所有进度","Controls":"控制","Action":"操作","Keyboard":"键盘","Pointer / touch":"指针/触摸","Move selection":"移动选择","Pop / fire":"流行/火灾","Tap a group":"点击一个组","Hint":"提示","Hint button":"提示按钮","Undo":"撤销","Undo button":"撤消按钮","Pause":"暂停","Pause button":"暂停按钮","Orbit camera":"轨道相机","Drag the board":"拖动棋盘","Goals":"目标","Score":"分数","Moves":"步数","Time":"时间","Wave":"波次","Move bank":"移动银行","Camera":"镜头","Paused":"已暂停","Resume":"继续","Restart round":"重新开始回合","Leave round":"离开回合","Results":"结算","Display name":"显示名称","Save to today's board":"保存到今天的看板","Retry":"重试","Next":"下一步","Menu":"菜单","Copy replay envelope":"复制回放信封","Cherry":"樱桃","Lemon":"柠檬","Leaf":"叶子","Sky":"天空","Grape":"葡萄","Tangerine":"橘子","Sunny Studio":"阳光工作室","Mint Workshop":"造币厂","Twilight Loft":"暮光阁楼","Candy Corner":"糖果角","Ivory Attic":"象牙阁楼","First Pops":"第一次流行","Tap any group of 2+ matching cubes to pop them. Fill the goals on the left.":"点击任何一组2个以上匹配的立方体来弹出它们。填写左侧的目标。","Bigger is Better":"越大越好","Bigger groups score more. Hunt for the largest cluster.":"更大的组得分更多。寻找最大的集群。","New: pop 5+ cubes at once to forge a rocket. Tap a rocket to clear its whole line.":"新功能：一次弹出 5 个以上的立方体来锻造火箭。点击火箭以清除其整条线。","Move Budget":"移动预算","New: a move limit. Every tap must count.":"新：移动限制。每一次点击都必须计数。","Tall Orders":"艰巨的任务","Bombs Away":"炸弹飞走","New: pop 8+ cubes for a bomb that clears everything around it.":"新：弹出 8 个以上的立方体即可获得炸弹，清除周围的一切。","Chain Reaction":"连锁反应","Blasts trigger other specials. Set up chains for huge scores.":"爆炸触发其他特殊物品。设置连锁以获得高分。","Corner Pocket":"角袋","Grape Arrives":"葡萄到达","Toy Chest":"玩具箱","MASTERY: everything so far, on a bigger wall.":"掌握：到目前为止的一切，在更大的墙上。","Wide Wall":"宽墙","Rocket Rally":"火箭拉力赛","Thin Ice":"薄冰","Bomb Squad":"炸弹小组","Beat the Clock":"争分夺秒","New: a time limit instead of a move limit. Pop briskly.":"新：时间限制而不是移动限制。轻快地流行起来。","Tangerine Twist":"橘子麻花","Full Spectrum":"全谱","Pressure Play":"压力玩法","Double Trouble":"双重麻烦","Studio Floor":"工作室地板","Grand Wall":"长城","The big wall: eight columns wide.":"大墙：八根柱宽。","Sky Harvest":"天丰","One huge sky quota, with a leaf side order.":"巨大的天空配额，叶边订单。","Clockwork Pop":"发条爆响","Rocket Science":"火箭科学","Deep Reserve":"深层储备","Blast Furnace":"高炉","Narrow Margin":"险胜","Speed Shelf":"速度架","Heavy Mix":"重混合","Grand Parade":"大游行","MASTERY: the full toy studio at once.":"掌握：立即完整的玩具工作室。","Chain Gang":"连锁小队","Blitz Wall":"闪电墙","Rocket Rain":"火箭雨","Bomb Voyage":"炸弹航行","Tight Squeeze":"紧挤","Long Haul":"长途运输","Time Crunch":"时间紧迫","Master Budget":"大师预算","Cube Carnival":"立方体嘉年华","MASTERY: the definitive wall. Good luck.":"掌握：最终的墙。祝你好运。","Two-Tone Tangle":"双音缠结","Speed Pop":"速度流行","Frugal Fingers":"节俭手指","Nine moves, no assists. Plan every pop.":"九次移动，没有助攻。计划好每一次流行。","Bomb Brigade":"炸弹旅","Bombs come easier (7+). Two big quotas.":"炸弹更容易出现（7+）。两个大配额。","Rocket Season":"火箭赛季","Rockets come easier (4+), bombs are off the menu.":"火箭变得更容易（4+），炸弹不再出现。","Grand Constraint":"至高约束","Move limit, time limit, no assists. The full test.":"步数限制、时间限制、无辅助。全面考验。","Casual":"休闲","Apprentice":"学徒","Expert":"专家","Endless Wall":"无尽的墙","Goals keep coming in waves. Each wave banked adds moves — play until the bank runs dry.":"目标不断涌现。每波堆积都会增加步数——玩到堤岸耗尽为止。","One shared seed for everyone, today only.":"所有人共享一个种子，仅限今日。","Pop a group":"弹出一个组","Forge a rocket":"锻造火箭","Groups of 5 or more leave a rocket behind. Pop the big cherry cluster in the middle — the cube you tap becomes the rocket.":"5 人或以上的团体留下一枚火箭。弹出中间的大樱桃簇——你点击的立方体就变成了火箭。","Fire a rocket":"发射火箭","A rocket sits on the wall. Tap it to clear its whole row or column in one blast.":"一枚火箭在墙上。点击它，一次爆炸清除整行或整列。","Chain reaction":"连锁反应","Two rockets share a row. Fire one — its blast sets off the other. Chained specials earn big bonus points.":"两枚火箭共用一排。发射一颗——它的爆炸会引爆另一颗。连锁特价可赚取巨额奖励积分。","Make a bomb":"制作炸弹","Groups of 8 or more leave a bomb that clears everything around it. Pop the huge cherry cluster to forge one.":"8 人或更多人组成的小组留下一枚炸弹，清除周围的一切。弹出巨大的樱桃簇来锻造一个。","Finish the stage":"完成阶段","The goal rail (left) asks for 2 cherry cubes. Pop the cherry pair to complete the stage — that is a win.":"球门栏杆（左）需要 2 个樱桃方块。弹出樱桃对来完成舞台——这是一场胜利。","Second chances":"第二次机会","In relaxed modes you can undo a pop (U) or ask for a hint (H). Pop any group, then undo it to finish the lesson.":"在轻松模式下，您可以撤消弹出 (U) 或请求提示 (H)。弹出任何组，然后撤消它以完成课程。","First Pop":"第一次流行","Pop your first group of cubes.":"弹出你的第一组立方体。","Goal Getter":"进球者","Complete all goals in a stage.":"完成一个关卡中的所有目标。","Rocketeer":"火箭手","Forge your first rocket.":"打造你的第一枚火箭。","Demolitionist":"拆除专家","Forge your first bomb.":"锻造你的第一颗炸弹。","Chain Artist":"连锁艺术家","Fire 3+ specials in a single move.":"单步发射 3 个以上的特殊技能。","Crowd Pleaser":"取悦人群","Pop a group of 12 or more cubes.":"弹出一组12个或更多的立方体。","Cube Veteran":"立方体老兵","Clear 1000 cubes in total.":"累计消除 1000 个方块。","Half the Journey":"旅程过半","Finish 20 journey stages.":"完成 20 个旅程关卡。","Studio Master":"工作室大师","Finish all 40 journey stages.":"完成全部 40 个旅程关卡。","Regular":"常规","Finish 7 daily challenges.":"完成 7 个每日挑战。","High Shelf":"高货架","Score 3000+ in a single round.":"在单个回合中获得 3000+ 分。","Music, effects and voice volumes and mute are in the StarHermit Options.":"音乐、音效和语音音量及静音设置位于 StarHermit 选项中。","Open Options":"打开选项","Graphics":"图形","Graphics quality, render scale and frame rate are in the StarHermit Options.":"画质、渲染比例和帧率设置位于 StarHermit 选项中。","Reduced motion, high contrast (with the high-contrast cube palette) and text size are in the StarHermit Options.":"减少运动、高对比度(使用高对比度立方体调色板)和文本大小在StarHermit选项中。","Change keys and buttons":"更改按键和按钮","Reset":"重置","Cancel":"取消"}
